        "title": "The Geometric Sum Formula",
        "text": "For a geometric series where $r \\neq 1$:\n$$S_n = \\frac{a(r^n - 1)}{r - 1}$$\n\nOr equivalently:\n$$S_n = \\frac{a(1 - r^n)}{1 - r}$$",
